This is a **[Meitou Client](https://github.com/VlcekM/MeitouClient)** C# code mod for Kenshi (it does not run on vanilla Kenshi or RE_Kenshi).

## Installation instructions

### Mod Manager (Vortex / MO2 / Amethyst)

1. Click **Mod Manager Download** on the **Files** tab (or import the downloaded {{ assembly_name }}-<version>.zip archive into your mod manager).
2. Install and enable the mod so the {{ assembly_name }}/ folder (containing {{ assembly_name }}.mod, meitou.json, and {{ assembly_name }}.dll) is deployed into your Kenshi mods/ directory.
3. Open **Meitou Launcher**, enable {{ assembly_name }}.mod in your load order, and launch **Meitou Client**.

### Manual installation

1. Download the latest archive from the **Files** tab on Nexus Mods.
2. Extract {{ assembly_name }}-<version>.zip into your Kenshi mods/ directory so the final path is <Kenshi>/mods/{{ assembly_name }}/{{ assembly_name }}.mod (alongside meitou.json and {{ assembly_name }}.dll).
3. Enable {{ assembly_name }}.mod in **Meitou Launcher** (or add {{ assembly_name }}.mod to <Kenshi>/data/mods.cfg) and launch **Meitou Client**.

### Uninstalling

Disable {{ assembly_name }}.mod in **Meitou Launcher** and remove the {{ assembly_name }}/ folder from <Kenshi>/mods/.

