## Issues/Incompatibility

Please report bugs, incompatibilities, or other issues on the [GitHub Issues]({{ (repo_url | trim).rstrip('/') }}/issues) page. Issues posted on Nexus Mods or Steam Workshop may be overlooked.

## Security & build verification

Meitou code mods run compiled C# inside the game process; third-party code mods are inherently potentially unsafe. Every Nexus Mods upload is the exact same ZIP built by GitHub Actions from the tagged source commit, with SHA-256 manifests, MSBuild binary logs, embedded portable PDBs/sources, and GitHub build-provenance attestations for both the ZIP and extracted DLL — see [Build Transparency & Verification]({{ (repo_url | trim).rstrip('/') }}#build-transparency--verification) and the release changelog links for verification commands and limitations.
